1. A schema for the player collection:

```javascript
const mongoose = require('mongoose');
const Schema = mongoose.Schema;

const playerSchema = new Schema({
  name: String,
  hand: [String],
  trickHistory: [{
    trickNum: Number,
    cards: [String]
  }],
