In Jetpack Compose, you can manually start recomposition by calling the `setContent` function again with the same composable function. Here's an example:

```kotlin
@Composable
fun MyLayout() {
    var value by remember { mutableStateOf(0) }

    Column(
        modifier = Modifier
            .fillMaxWidth()
            .padding(16.dp),
        horizontalAlignment = Alignment.CenterHorizontally
    ) {
        Text(text = "Value: $value", fontSize = 24.sp)
