In C# MAUI (Multi-platform App UI), implementing the MVU (Model-View-Update) pattern can be done using the `Microsoft.Maui.Controls.Compatibility` library, which provides the `DotNetMauiExperimentApp` classes to build a cross-platform app using MVU. Here's an example of a simple counter app using MVU in a C# MAUI project:

First, install the necessary NuGet package:

```sh
dotnet add package Microsoft.Maui.Controls.Compatibility --prerelease
```

Now, replace the content of your `MainPage.xaml.cs` or `MainPage.cs` file with this:

```csharp
