```cpp
TWeakObjectPtr<ARagnaAbilTargetActor_GroundTrace> TargetActorGroundTrace;
```

2. When destroying the widget after the ability is used, make sure to also reset or release the reference in your player controller. This will avoid any dangling pointers or references.

Here's an example of how you can handle the creation and destruction of the targeting widget:

**Player Controller:**

