Now let's create the sketch for the second Arduino Nano board. In this sketch, we will receive the sensor data from the first Arduino board and display it using 6 LEDs. We will also read the status of 4 switches and send the commands to the first Arduino board to control the outputs.

Second Arduino Nano board sketch:
```cpp
#include <SPI.h>
#include <Ethernet.h>

