  <svg ref={svgRef} width="100" height="100">
    <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" stroke="black" strokeWidth="3" fill="red" />
  </svg>
);
// ...
```

4. Access the SVG class (or any other property) using the `current` property of the ref:

```javascript
// Call this function to get the SVG class
