2. Assuming you have initialized a WebClient instance, make a request and access the header value:

```java
// Assuming this.client is the WebClient instance
Mono<String> correlationId = this.client
    .get() // or POST, PUT, etc. depending on your requirement
    .uri("https://example.com/api/your-endpoint")
    .exchangeToMono(response -> {
        // Access "correlation_id" header value
