Java SDK提供了用于连接到AWS IoT MQTT网络的API。您可以使用Java编写的AWS IoT CLI例子，然后按照下面的步骤设置证书。

以下是Java代码示例，说明如何连接到AWS IoT MQTT网络：

```java
import software.amazon.awssdk.crt.*;
import software.amazon.awssdk.crt.mqtt.*;
import software.amazon.awssdk.crt.auth.credentials.*;
import java.util.concurrent.*;

public class AwsIotMqtt {
    private static final String endpoint = "<your_endpoint>";
    private static final String certificate_file = "<your_certificate_file>";
    private static final String private_key_file = "<your_private_key_file>";
    private static final String ca_file = "<your_ca_file>";
    private static final String client_id = "<your_client_id>";

    public static void main(final String[] args) {
        CrtResource.init();
        try {
            // Set up event loop group and client bootstrap
            EventLoopGroup eventLoopGroup = new EventLoopGroup(1);
            MqttClientConnectionConfigBuilder builder = MqttClientConnectionConfig.builder()
                .endpoint(endpoint)
                .clientId(client_id)
                .certFile(certificate_file)
                .keyFile(private_key_file)
                .caFile(ca_file)
                .build();
            MqttClientBase client = new MqttClientBuilder()
                .withConnectionConfig(builder)
                .withWebSocketOptions(new WebSocketOptions())
                .withAutoReconnect(true)
                .withOfflinePublishQueueEnabled(true)
                .withEventLoopGroup(eventLoopGroup)
                .build();

            // Set up subscription message handling
            CompletableFuture<Boolean> subscribed = new CompletableFuture<>();
            client.subscribe("test/topic", MqttQos.AT_LEAST_ONCE, (topic, payload) -> {
                System.out.format("Received message on %s: %s\n", topic, payload);
                subscribed.complete(true);
            });

            // Wait for subscription to complete
            subscribed.get();

            // Publish a message
            String message = "Hello, world!";
            client.publish("test/topic", MqttQos.AT_LEAST_ONCE, message.getBytes()).get();

            // Shut down the client gracefully
            client.close().get();
            eventLoopGroup.close();
        } catch (Exception e) {
            System.out.println("Exception encountered: " + e.getMessage());
        } finally {
            CrtResource.releaseAll();   // Release resources
        }
    }
}
```

您需要设置以下变量才能运行此代码示例：
- endpoint: 您将连接的AWS IoT MQTT服务器终端节点。
- certificate_file: 包含您的AWS IoT Thing的证书的文件路径。
- private_key_file: 包含您的私钥的文件路径。
- ca_file: 包含AWS IoT根CA证书的文件路径。
- client_id: 您为连接创建的客户端ID。

此代码示例实现以下操作：
1. 设置连接配置对象。
2. 创建MqttClientBase对象并订阅test/topic主题。
3. 在订阅完成后，发布消息到test/topic主题。
4. 关闭MqttClientBase对象并释放资源。

请注意，此代码示例中的订阅操作使用了CompletableFuture来等待订阅的完成。这是一种异步编程的技术，它使代码流程更加清晰和易读。

