The full code for this ASP.NET Core microservice implementing the Saga State Machine orchestration pattern using MassTransit and RabbitMQ for the message bus as well as MongoDb as the state machines repository can be quite extensive. Here, I will provide you with a basic setup, and you can modify it as per your requirements.

1. Install NuGet packages:

- Install Masstransit
- Install Masstransit.AspNetCore
