To convert an Excel file to an HTML table, we can use the `xlsx` library in combination with JavaScript. First, include the library using a CDN by adding the following to your HTML:

```html
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/xlsx/0.17.0/xlsx.full.min.js"></script>
```

Then, create a file input field and an HTML table element in your HTML:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
