3. Update the configtx.yaml and core.yaml files with your network's configuration. You can use the sample configurations from the ['test-network'](https://github.com/hyperledger/fabric-samples/tree/main/test-network) folder as a reference.

4. Update the 'connection-court.yaml' and 'connection-police.yaml' files with profiles to connect to Orderer and their respective Peers.

5. Update the 'case.go' chaincode with the following code. This chaincode now includes the structure for the case details:

