  });
```

In this example, we enable the 1904 date system by setting the option `use1904` to `true` when creating the `Workbook` object. We then set a formula in cell A1 that uses date values and will correctly work with the 1904 date system.

Please note that enabling the 1904 date system will affect all date-related calculations in the workbook and is not specific to individual cells.

