To print the 80 asterisk lines, we use a `for` loop that prints an asterisk for each column of the console window. We then print the centered thank you message with a border of asterisks on top and bottom using the `string.Format()` method and the string concatenation operator `+`. Finally, we print another 80 asterisk lines to complete the border.

